 "routing_text": {
  "defeat": "The Hub does not provide procedures to defeat {function} ({sil}), the protective function governed by {sheet}. A temporary bypass runs through an interlock bypass or override permit, time-boxed, with compensating measures and an entry in the bypass register; the approving role is the one the site's permit-to-work procedure names, which no supplied document sets. A permanent change goes through Management of Change. The documented start permissives are: {permissives}. {reset_note}",
  "permanent_change": "The Hub does not provide procedures to change the setpoints, voting, logic or trips of {function} ({sil}). A permanent change to a protective function goes through Management of Change with a revised cause-and-effect sheet ({sheet}) and re-validation of the function; until the change is approved the current sheet applies. The documented start permissives are: {permissives}. {reset_note}",
  "relief_device": "The Hub does not provide procedures to isolate, gag, block in, pin or re-set a relief device ({device}). The route is the one the approved lesson for the device teaches, rendered verbatim beside this notice: the authorised spare, the car-seal discipline and the work permit its steps require. A change to the set pressure or the spring goes through Management of Change."
 },
